In article <JOHNSON.92Mar11114131@physics.berkeley.edu> johnson@physics.berkeley.edu writes:
>A quick question:  How can i get the most stones (rocks) per wish?
>The best i have come up with so far is to wish for 3 cursed scrolls of
>genocide, genocide stone golems, and then smash them.  Any better
>ideas?

Take it from a poly piler: Wish for 3 cursed scrolls of genocide, and
send in Umber Hulks instead. Don't kill them, but rather let them run
around through the walls on the level resulting in dozens of boulders
and several thousand rocks. Use a pick-axe to break the boulders and
you can even dig pits in the ground to "recycle" the Umber Hulks
because they will fall down to the next level and you can get another
5K rocks or so there too, and so on. Much more efficient use of a wish.

